In the new year, you will face various expenses every day. If you are a student, you will eat and shop every day, and the living expenses will reach the bottom before the end of the month;

If you are a novice in the workplace, your monthly salary may not be enough within a few days. Do you want to know where the money is spent? Don't hurry up to form the habit of bookkeeping. Whether you record the daily food and beverage bookkeeping or shopping bookkeeping, you can record in detail, as well as the detailed statistics and calendar functions, so that the daily consumption is clearly visible. If you use electronic bookkeeping software to replace paper book records in your life, you can not only carry them with you and record them at any time, but also have classified revenue and expenditure and statistical functions, and more support multi-ledger bookkeeping.

[App introduction]

This is a cartoon style electronic bookkeeping book, and it is also an easy to use and powerful bookkeeping software with powerful functions and huge storage capacity.

[Use of accounting software]

Create an account book and select the corresponding account book to be bookkept;

Support various classified expenses such as shopping/transportation/study/housing, and keep it as you like;

Automatically generate statistics, and the details of each month are clear at a glance;

[App features]

Cartoon style, more healing, let you record good mood every day;

Multiple records are supported, and continuous bookkeeping can be supported without switching;

Support ledger and electronic ledger without fear of loss;

We welcome you to use this electronic bookkeeping software. Our purpose is to let you know your expenses clearly, so that you can record your reasonable and unreasonable expenses, so that you can save more money, form a good habit of saving money, and avoid unnecessary consumption; If you have better suggestions and opinions, please contact us at the personal center, and we will try to do better.

If you have any questions, please contact us in the app to provide us with suggestions or feedback.

